{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734198",
      "title": "Working with Query Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "f0ee575686f56389c344c7b38b480581a8ab25f121c8bc6e68e5fcea52055170",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 2.97,
          "en": "So, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "I wanna dive into another routing concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "we haven't learned about yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 8.52,
          "en": "which fits very well into this example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 11.79,
          "en": "which is why I'm covering it here in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.79,
          "end": 14.22,
          "en": "We get this button here on this auth form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.22,
          "end": 15.87,
          "en": "which basically allows us to switch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.87,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "to the create new user mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 19.11,
          "en": "In the end, it's the same form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.11,
          "end": 22.2,
          "en": "but what will change at least later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.2,
          "end": 25.53,
          "en": "is that in one case, if we click save",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.53,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "we do actually try to log in the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 31.71,
          "en": "we send a log in request to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.71,
          "end": 34.98,
          "en": "On the other hand, if we are in create a new user mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.98,
          "end": 36.96,
          "en": "we send a request to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.96,
          "end": 39.09,
          "en": "that wants to create a new user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "So we're sending different requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 44.55,
          "en": "based on which kind of form we loaded here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 46.53,
          "en": "We could also enhance the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.53,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "with an extra password confirmation input, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 52.05,
          "en": "if we are creating a new user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 52.05,
          "end": 53.49,
          "en": "but will not do that here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 53.49,
          "end": 56.013,
          "en": "but I'd like to switch between these two modes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.51,
          "end": 58.89,
          "en": "And as you can of course tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 58.89,
          "end": 61.98,
          "en": "we are able to switch between those two modes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 64.08,
          "en": "But at the moment, this is implemented",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 64.08,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "with help of useState and this logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "where I basically toggle this isLogin state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "whenever I click this button down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 75.45,
          "en": "That of course works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 76.71000000000001,
          "en": "there's nothing wrong with it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 76.71000000000001,
          "end": 79.56,
          "en": "and you could keep it that way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.56,
          "end": 81.99,
          "en": "However, we could also leverage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 81.99,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "a standard web concept for managing this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "We could leverage query parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 91.26,
          "en": "search parameters as they're also called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "Now, a query parameter is in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 94.8,
          "en": "a parameter that's appended",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 94.8,
          "end": 98.28,
          "en": "in the URL after a question mark.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 98.28,
          "end": 100.2,
          "en": "And we could say that we, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 100.2,
          "end": 102.69,
          "en": "wanna support a mode query parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.69,
          "end": 105.99000000000001,
          "en": "which is either set to log in or to sign up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 105.99000000000001,
          "end": 108.47999999999999,
          "en": "And depending on what it's set to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 108.47999999999999,
          "end": 111.66,
          "en": "we wanna load a different version of that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 114.57,
          "en": "So it's the same route, it's the same path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 114.57,
          "end": 117.47999999999999,
          "en": "the path is always /auth,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 119.19,
          "en": "but we get this extra parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 121.83,
          "en": "which defines how exactly this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 121.83,
          "end": 123.45,
          "en": "should be rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 123.45,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "And that's not uncommon to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 125.49,
          "end": 128.73,
          "en": "and an advantage of using query parameters would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 128.73,
          "end": 130.98,
          "en": "that we can directly link to this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 130.98,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "in signup or log in mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 137.1,
          "en": "so that we could link a user directly to the signup page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 137.1,
          "end": 138.78,
          "en": "even though it's one at the same page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 138.78,
          "end": 141.243,
          "en": "just with a different UI being rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "And that's why I want to replace this state based logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 146.1,
          "end": 148.41,
          "en": "with my query parameter logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 150.42000000000002,
          "en": "not because it's generally better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 150.42000000000002,
          "end": 153.99,
          "en": "but because it offers these advantages I mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 156.36,
          "en": "Now to switch to that state based logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 156.36,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "I will get rid of this switch off handler function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.15,
          "en": "and the useState call here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 162.15,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "and we can get rid of the useState import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 170.82,
          "en": "And instead now I want to replace my button down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 170.82,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "which I use for toggling with a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "So here I will use that link component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 179.613,
          "en": "from react-router-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 180.57,
          "end": 184.2,
          "en": "and I'll then replace this button here with that link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.2,
          "end": 186.03,
          "en": "get rid of that type attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 186.03,
          "end": 188.64,
          "en": "and get rid of the onClick handler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 188.64,
          "end": 192.033,
          "en": "And instead we set the to prop on that link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 193.05,
          "end": 195.24,
          "en": "Now, where do we wanna link to?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 195.24,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "Well, we wanna stay on the auth page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 199.38,
          "en": "so we could link to /auth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 201.84,
          "en": "but that's redundant since we can also just set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 201.84,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "a relative link that stays",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 205.203,
          "en": "on the currently active route anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 206.1,
          "end": 208.77,
          "en": "Therefore, I just wanna add my query parameters here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 208.77,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "by adding this question mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 212.37,
          "en": "and then the name of my parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 212.37,
          "end": 213.873,
          "en": "which here is mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 218.82,
          "en": "Then I set this equal to and then the value to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 221.37,
          "en": "which it should be set when we click this link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 221.37,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "And that should be either log in or sign up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 226.92000000000002,
          "en": "depending on whether we are currently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 226.92000000000002,
          "end": 229.47,
          "en": "on the login or signup page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 231.39,
          "en": "If we are on the log in page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 231.39,
          "end": 234.18,
          "en": "if we are in login mode to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "then I wanna set this to sign up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 239.16,
          "en": "If we are in signup mode, I wanna set it to log in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 239.16,
          "end": 242.46,
          "en": "so that we can switch to the opposite mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 242.46,
          "end": 245.88,
          "en": "Therefore, this must be set dynamically here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 245.88,
          "end": 248.52,
          "en": "and I will use the template literal notation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 248.52,
          "end": 251.28,
          "en": "to easily inject something here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 251.28,
          "end": 252.84,
          "en": "But the something I wanna inject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 252.84,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "is of course based on the currently selected mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 258.9,
          "en": "and I of course want to manage my mode here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 258.9,
          "end": 261.633,
          "en": "with query parameters as I just mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 262.68,
          "end": 264.09,
          "en": "Therefore, I must get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 264.09,
          "end": 266.19,
          "en": "to the currently set query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 266.19,
          "end": 268.26,
          "en": "to know in which mode I am.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 268.26,
          "end": 269.88,
          "en": "I also need that information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 269.88,
          "end": 273.36,
          "en": "to correctly set the title and so on, by the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 273.36,
          "end": 275.07,
          "en": "Now, react-router gives us a hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 275.07,
          "end": 276.84000000000003,
          "en": "that makes it easy to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 276.84000000000003,
          "end": 279.21,
          "en": "to the currently set query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 279.21,
          "end": 281.79,
          "en": "And the hook is called useSearchParams",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 281.79,
          "end": 283.32,
          "en": "because query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 283.32,
          "end": 285.603,
          "en": "are officially called search parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 287.37,
          "end": 289.92,
          "en": "We can call useSearchParams here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 289.92,
          "end": 292.29,
          "en": "and this actually returns an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 292.29,
          "end": 294.36,
          "en": "and hence we can use array destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 294.36,
          "end": 297.33,
          "en": "to get access to the elements in that array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 297.33,
          "end": 300.63,
          "en": "And there are two elements in that array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 300.63,
          "end": 304.38,
          "en": "The first element is an object that gives us access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 304.38,
          "end": 307.47,
          "en": "to the currently set query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 307.47,
          "end": 310.68,
          "en": "and the second value we get from that array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 310.68,
          "end": 313.05,
          "en": "is a function that allows us to update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 313.05,
          "end": 315.093,
          "en": "the currently set query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 316.11,
          "end": 317.85,
          "en": "Now, I don't need that function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 317.85,
          "end": 320.01,
          "en": "because I will update the query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 320.01,
          "end": 323.07,
          "en": "with help of that link that sets the query parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 323.07,
          "end": 324.57,
          "en": "but I do need to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 324.57,
          "end": 327.6,
          "en": "to the currently active query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 327.6,
          "end": 329.97,
          "en": "Therefore, I will just get that first element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 329.97,
          "end": 331.32,
          "en": "from that array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 331.32,
          "end": 333.27,
          "en": "and then here we can get the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 333.27,
          "end": 336.03,
          "en": "whether we are in log in mode or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 336.03,
          "end": 338.97,
          "en": "by accessing this search patterns object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 338.97,
          "end": 340.98,
          "en": "And then there is a get method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 340.98,
          "end": 343.40999999999997,
          "en": "which allows us to retrieve the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 343.40999999999997,
          "end": 346.35,
          "en": "for a specific query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 346.35,
          "end": 348.99,
          "en": "And here it's the mode query parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 348.99,
          "end": 351.75,
          "en": "I wanna retrieve the value for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 351.75,
          "end": 354.57,
          "en": "and I wanna check if the value is equal to log in.",
